<!--
  Only genuinely public addresses.

  Deliberately NOT listed: /singz, /rapz, /postz and the rest of the tab
  routes. They are behind RequireAuth, so a crawler is bounced to the login
  screen — a page that answers a request with somebody else's page is a soft
  404, and listing it invites the crawler to find that out repeatedly.

  Also not listed, because they cannot be enumerated from a static file:
  /p/<id> posts, /u/<username> profiles and /pl/<id> playlists. Those are the
  pages worth indexing most, and they need a per-URL title and description the
  SPA cannot give them — see the note in the pull request.
-->
